cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VOTCLOC surface viewer (app_manual_delineation_helper)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Streamlit surface viewer for VOTCLOC manual ROI delineation: renders an
  inflated or pial FreeSurfer surface for either hemisphere with a statistical
  heatmap overlay and atlas or manually drawn labels, to support interactive
  delineation of reading-related regions in ventral occipitotemporal cortex.
